<title>PERU: Alico buys 38 pct stake in Pacifico Vida.</title>
<headline>Alico buys 38 pct stake in Pacifico Vida.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. company Alico Inc bought 38 percent of Peruvian insurance company  Pacifico Vida for $5.3 million, according to the Lima Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The bolsa's daily report said Alico bought a package of 565,440 shares for 24.67 soles ($9.38) per share.</p>
<p>((-- Eduardo Orozco, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
